scope: |
  Capture the parenthesised parameter type in uniml's `def` parameter loop instead of skipping it,
  so `def go(t: (Int, String))` records `Param.tpe` and the default front stops refusing a call
  that v3's own front accepts (invariant I-3). One call site in ScalaSpike.scala, reusing
  `captureType`, which already handles the balanced-paren domain. Closing the entry in v3/BUGS.md
  with a before/after corpus measurement taken on this host.
next: A/B the corpus report before/after, then close the entry
